      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e1",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_3",
      "quote": "Available data suggested that, despite pharmacologic thromboprophylaxis, there is a substantial residual risk of VTE and a non-negligible risk of bleeding events [3, 5]. In addition, it remains unclear whether prophylactic or higher doses of anticoagulants may reduce in-hospital mortality in COVID-19 patients [6, 7].",
      "reason": "The background describes what is known (residual VTE risk and bleeding despite prophylaxis) and important uncertainties (whether higher doses reduce in-hospital mortality)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_3",
      "quote": "These observations left clinicians uncertain about the need for higher doses of thromboprophylaxis and resulted in heterogeneous indications from different guidance documents, in particular for critically ill patients.",
      "reason": "The importance/need for the review is explained via clinician uncertainty and inconsistent guidance regarding higher-dose thromboprophylaxis, especially in critically ill patients."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e3",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No evidence retrieved describes existing similar systematic reviews or explains how the current review relates to them (updates/replications with citations)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e4",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The retrieved Introduction text does not briefly describe the proposed mechanism of action of the intervention (high-dose vs low-dose thromboprophylaxis)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e5",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No logic model or hypothesised relationships between intervention components and outcomes are provided in the retrieved evidence."
