      "quote": "RCTs including hospitalized patients with objectively diagnosed SARS-CoV2 infection and comparing high-dose anticoagulation (experimental group) with low-dose anticoagulation (control group) were eligible. Studies with a non-randomised design or published in languages other than English were excluded.",
      "reason": "The eligibility decision components for population and study design are specified (hospitalized adults with objectively diagnosed SARS-CoV-2; RCTs; high-dose vs low-dose anticoagulation; experimental vs control). However, the evidence provided does not specify all “relevant question-framework components” (e.g., detailed eligible settings and any follow-up requirements) for determining eligibility."
